sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant N as Nginx Gateway
    participant A as FastAPI (Blue)
    participant R as Redis Stream
    participant W as Detection Worker
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant WH as Webhook

    C->>N: POST /api/v1/records/batch (HTTPS)
    N->>A: Proxy to active upstream
    A->>A: Validate JWT / API Key
    A->>A: Validate Pydantic schema (1-5000 records)
    A->>P: INSERT ingestion_jobs (status=queued)
    loop For each record in batch
        A->>R: XADD cost_records {payload, job_id, enqueued_at}
    end
    A-->>C: 202 Accepted {job_id, accepted, status}

    Note over W: Consumer group loop (XREADGROUP)
    R->>W: Deliver batch of messages
    W->>W: Parse + sort by timestamp
    loop For each record
        W->>P: Upsert resource (INSERT or SELECT)
        W->>P: INSERT cost_record (ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING)
        W->>P: Load baseline (n, mean, m2)
        W->>W: Welford update baseline
        W->>W: Evaluate rules (z-score, pct, EWMA, new-resource)
        alt Anomaly detected
            W->>P: INSERT/UPDATE anomaly
            W->>P: INSERT alert
        end
        W->>P: Save updated baseline
    end
    W->>W: Aggregate check per hour
    W->>P: COMMIT transaction
    W->>R: XACK batch
    opt Webhook configured
        W->>WH: POST alert notification
    end
